  equations using Cholesky decomposition. Specifically, if \\(m \ge n\\) then
  \\(X = (A^T A + \lambda I)^{-1} A^T B\\), which solves the least-squares
  problem \\(X = \mathrm{argmin}_{Z \in \Re^{n \times k}} ||A Z - B||_F^2 +
